{"version":1,"content":"<p>俄羅斯聯邦安全局（FSB）周日（ 11月1日）宣布，在接獲美國執法部門提供的情報後，拘捕一名涉嫌企圖在莫斯科一家博物館策劃恐怖襲擊的俄籍少年。</p><p>俄方對美國協助表示感謝。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:04.544369+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:31:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:38:48.690414+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:09.058470+00:00","content_hash":"70c7d72e3e1dee7d10991dae629a74c3785057af8fb45aa080304caf6996a39f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}